Package: pipal
Version: 3.4.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, ruby
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/digininja/pipal
Description: Password analyser and statistics generator
 pipal helps analyse password lists, extracting statistics such as
 character counts, digit positions, the most common patterns, and
 passwords that instantly fail typical password policies. Great for
 building realistic wordlists or auditing password dumps.
